<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Drawing on expertise from Dr Kathryn Witzeman, Dr Sofia Cooper, and Sharnie Dwyer, this guide combines anatomy, psychology, and nutrition to demystify desire, consent, protection, and pleasure. It acknowledges the cultural taboos and misinformation that surround sex, offering instead a factual, respectful, and compassionate approach to one of the most intimate parts of being human.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [24]
>>
