/E (Alice Zaslavsky is a well-known Australian food writer after participating in the MasterChef Australia, and she also advocates for food education. Her works include several award-winning cookbooks. The works In Praise of Veg and Better Cooking  are praised for their approachable, humorous style and easy-to-follow guidance, helping readers build confidence in the kitchen.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [37 38]
